\description{
A MuData object backed by an H5MU file. Construction reads only the root
attributes; global slots are read on access and modalities are returned as
read-only \code{anndataR} \code{HDF5AnnData} objects reading \verb{/mod/<name>} of the
same file (replace a modality with \code{mdata[[name]] <- adata}). Their Awkward
Arrays are available with \code{\link[=get_awkward]{get_awkward()}}. Open one with \code{\link[=read_h5mu]{read_h5mu()}}.
}
